# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.5.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JAVA-COMMONSLANG-10734077:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Uncontrolled Recursion in the legacy commons-lang:commons-lang@2.6, a build-time-only
          transitive dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass (JSON Schema -> POJO codegen plugin
          used in crime-commons-schemas/crime-commons-mod-schemas; not part of any published
          runtime jar). Fix requires jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0, which no released version of
          org.jsonschema2dataclass uses yet (latest, 6.1.0, pins jsonschema2pojo-core 1.2.2).
          Tracked in LASB-5312; re-evaluate once js2d-gradle ships a release built on
          jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0+.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHECOMMONS-10734078:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Uncontrolled Recursion in org.apache.commons:commons-lang3@3.17.0, a build-time-only
          transitive dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass. Same root cause as
          SNYK-JAVA-COMMONSLANG-10734077 - fix requires jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0, not yet used
          by any released org.jsonschema2dataclass version. Tracked in LASB-5312.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-19778370:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling in
          com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind@2.17.2, a build-time-only transitive
          dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass. No fix available even via jsonschema2pojo-core
          1.3.0 (which pins jackson 2.21.0) - the actual fix versions are 2.18.10 / 2.21.6 / 2.22.2,
          none of which any released org.jsonschema2dataclass/jsonschema2pojo-core combination
          currently ships. Tracked in LASB-5312; re-evaluate as upstream releases progress.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
